everity\": \"WARNING\",\n          \"check\": \"CROSS-REFERENCE\",\n          \"description\": \"Door schedule shows 25 active NEW doors. For a gut renovation, the existing door count should be similar. 19 existing doors for demo seems low — where did the other ~6 doors go?\",\n          \"evidence\": \"New schedule: 25 doors (26 minus NOT USED). Executor found 19 demo doors. Delta of 6 means either: (a) 6 new doors go into locations that previously had no doors, or (b) executor undercounted.\",\n          \"recommendation\": \"Recount from high-res drawings. The 17-21 range from image analysis suggests uncertainty. 19 is plausible but could be 21-22.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n          \"check\": \"UNIT CONSISTENCY\",\n          \"description\": \"Unit EA matches bid breakdown. All doors appear to be single doors per executor — no double doors identified in existing layout.\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Bid item specifies 'single doors'. Executor counted only X-marked doors.\",\n          \"recommendation\": \"Verify no existing double doors (e.g., Mechanical Room entry).\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"revised_quantity\": null,\n      \"escalate_to_doug\": false,\n      \"confidence_assessment\": \"MEDIUM — 19 is plausible but likely ±2-3 doors\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"item_number\": 13,\n      \"executor_quantity\": 48,\n      \"executor_unit\": \"LF\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FLAG\",\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"severity\": \"WARNING\",\n          \"check\": \"OVERLAP/DOUBLE COUNT\",\n          \"description\": \"Executor included keynote 10 (steel+glass casework) in this item AND acknowledged overlap with Item 20 (shelving) via keynote 17/23 which references 'millwork cubbies'. If cubbies are counted in both Items 13 and 20, there's double-counting.\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Item 13 includes 'miscellaneous ~10 LF' which could overlap with Item 20's 24 LF. Executor flagged this but didn't resolve it.\",\n    