{"type":"message","id":"0ff4e8bb","parentId":"56190cd7","timestamp":"2026-01-30T21:44:03.394Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Critic review complete.** Written to `critic_review_demo.json`.\n\n### Key findings:\n\n1. **CRITICAL — Item 23 (Carting)**: Internal math error. Rollup uses 15 doors but Item 12 says 19. Should be ≥49 EA, not 45.\n\n2. **CRITICAL — Item 11 (4th Floor R&R)**: 3,500 SF is a blind guess. No 4th floor drawings. Recommend Doug price two scenarios (50% and 100%). Ceiling type (ACT vs GWB) changes cost by 5x.\n\n3. **WARNING — Items 13+20 overlap**: Combined 72 LF of millwork + shelving may double-count \"cubbies.\" Need clear delineation.\n\n4. **WARNING — Item 8 (Partitions)**: ±20% uncertainty from combined height × length unknowns. Should be downgraded from medium to low confidence.\n\n5. **WARNING — Item 18 (Fridge)**: Executor found 1, task packet said 2. Recommend using 2.\n\n6. **WARNING — Item 21 (Floor Boxes)**: Right answer (24 SF) arrived at via wrong math (4×6 vs task packet's 13×2). Fragile estimate.\n\n7. **INFO — Items 9/10**: Both 3,500 SF but should differ if Mech Room ceiling is ACT but floor is epoxy.\n\n**Verdicts**: 5 ACCEPT, 11 FLAG (including 2 with CRITICAL issues). Two items escalated to Doug (Items 11 and 23)."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":387,"cacheRead":46210,"cacheWrite":6953,"totalTokens":53551,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.009675000000000001,"cacheRead":0.023105,"cacheWrite":0.04345625,"total":0.07624125000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769809433887}}
